<div class="rv"><span class="tag">About HOPE DA</span><h2>Rebuilding children from the inside out.</h2>
<p>HOPE DA is a children's ministry founded in 2023 by <b>Atika Jonathan</b> in Kasire, Juba. Years of hardship have left many children in South Sudan unsure of their worth, their voice and their future.</p>
<p>We walk with them — through faith, mentorship, learning and love — until they understand who they are, and find themselves again.</p>
<a class="btn b1" href="#programs">See What We Do</a></div>
<div class="rv"><div class="quote">“Our vision is to rebuild children to understand who they are and find themselves again.”<small>— Atika Jonathan, Founder</small></div></div>
</div></section>

